{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019iajJZCSxNF1s3fcbMCXne","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Feature: Workspace Skeleton, Core Types, RNG, and Save/Load\n\n## Description\nBootstrap the Cargo workspace with all four crates (`tank_core`, `tank_data`, `tank_tui`, `tank_scenarios`), define the full domain type hierarchy (`TankState`, `TankGeometry`, `WaterState`, `PlayerAction`, `SimEvent`, `TankSnapshot`, etc.), implement the deterministic RNG wrapper using `ChaCha8Rng`, wire up JSON save/load with schema and app versioning, and establish the `SimulationEngine` trait with a minimal concrete implementation that can apply actions to a queue and step through empty ticks. This is Milestone 1 from the spec — the foundation every subsequent feature builds on.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Cargo workspace compiles with four crates: `tank_core`, `tank_data`, `tank_tui`, `tank_scenarios`; `tank_core` has no TUI dependencies\n- [ ] `TankGeometry` struct is defined with all fields (`length_cm`, `width_cm`, `height_cm`, `fill_height_cm`, `glass_thickness_mm`, `open_top`) and derives `water_volume_l`, `surface_area_cm2`, `footprint_area_cm2`, `wall_area_cm2`, `mean_depth_cm`, `surface_area_to_volume_ratio`, `wall_area_to_volume_ratio`\n- [ ] `WaterState` stores all required dissolved pools as total amounts (`ammonia_total_mg_n_total`, `nitrite_mg_n_total`, `nitrate_mg_n_total`, `phosphate_mg_p_total`, `dissolved_oxygen_mg_total`, `dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total`, `dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total`, `dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total`, `alkalinity_meq_total`, and all 7 ion totals: Ca, Mg, Na, K, HCO3, Cl, SO4)\n- [ ] `TankSnapshot` derives all display values: `tan_mg_l`, `nh3_mg_l`, `nitrite_mg_l`, `nitrate_mg_l`, `phosphate_mg_l`, `do_mg_l`, `gh_d`, `kh_d`, `tds_mg_l`, `conductivity_us_cm`, `ph` using the exact formulas from the spec\n- [ ] `PlayerAction` enum defined with all 12 variants and validation logic that returns typed `SimError` (percentages in `0.0..=1.0` or `0.0..=100.0` as specified, non-negative grams/counts)\n- [ ] `SimEvent` struct with `day`, `hour`, `severity`, `kind`, `cause_codes`, `summary`; `EventKind` enum with all 13 required variants; `EventSeverity` enum (Info, Warning, Critical)\n- [ ] `SimSeed(u64)` wraps `ChaCha8Rng`; the RNG is stored in `TankState`; no thread-local RNG is used anywhere in `tank_core`\n- [ ] `SimulationEngine` trait implemented with `apply_action`, `step_hours`, `snapshot`, `full_state`; actions are queued and processed at the start of each hourly tick in insertion order\n- [ ] `TankState` contains all top-level sub-states: geometry, environment (ambient temp, hour-of-day, day counter), hardware (light, heater, filter, aeration), water, substrate layers, filter state, plant guild states, algae state, microbe state, microfauna state, animal (shrimp) state, detritus state, event log, and RNG\n- [ ] Save file is JSON containing: `schema_version`, `app_version`, full `TankState`, queued actions, and serialized RNG state\n- [ ] `save_load_roundtrip` test: create a state with a non-default seed, serialize to JSON, deserialize, and assert the restored state is identical (field-by-field equality)\n- [ ] `determinism_basic` test: two engines with the same seed stepping 24 hours produce identical snapshots\n- [ ] `action_validation` test: invalid actions (negative grams, out-of-range percentages, etc.) return `Err(SimError)` with descriptive variants\n- [ ] `action_queuing` test: multiple actions queued for the same tick are processed in insertion order\n- [ ] Invariant checks run after every `step_hours` call: no negative mass pools, no negative populations, index values clamped to `0.0..=1.0`, temperature above `0.0 C`\n- [ ] `tank_data` crate has TOML deserialization scaffolding with `serde` and `toml`; preset structs for source water, substrate, plant, and shrimp profiles are defined (loading actual preset files is included)\n- [ ] All preset TOML files created: source water (`soft_acidic`, `moderate`, `hard_shrimp`, `ro_like`), substrate (`inert_sand`, `inert_gravel`, `active_planted`, `coarse_porous`), plants (`fast_stem`, `root_rosette`), shrimp (`neocaridina_davidi`), process parameters (one default pack), and scenarios (`nano_cycle`, `medium_planted`, `warm_room`)\n- [ ] `open_top = false` stores a configurable lid factor (default `0.25`) that will reduce surface exchange rates when those systems are implemented\n\n## Files to Modify/Create\n- `Cargo.toml` - Workspace root with members `crates/tank_core`, `crates/tank_data`, `crates/tank_tui`, `crates/tank_scenarios`\n- `crates/tank_core/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `serde`, `serde_json`, `rand`, `rand_chacha`, `thiserror`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/lib.rs` - Module re-exports\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs` - Module declarations for all type modules\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs` - `TankGeometry` with derived calculations\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs` - `WaterState` with all dissolved pools\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/environment.rs` - `EnvironmentState` (ambient temp, time tracking)\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/hardware.rs` - `LightState`, `HeaterState`, `FilterHardware`, `AerationState`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs` - `SubstrateLayerState`, `SubstrateKind`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` - `PlantGuildState`, `AlgaeState`, `MicrobeState`, `MicrofaunaState`, `AnimalState` (shrimp), `DetritusState`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/events.rs` - `SimEvent`, `EventKind`, `EventSeverity`, `EventCause`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` - `TankSnapshot` with all derived display values and construction from `TankState`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` - `PlayerAction` enum, validation, `SimError`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs` - `TankState` aggregate, `SimMeta`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/rng.rs` - `SimRng` wrapper around `ChaCha8Rng` with `SimSeed`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` - `SimulationEngine` trait and concrete `Engine` struct with action queuing, tick stepping, snapshot generation\n- `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` - `SaveFile` struct, serialize/deserialize with schema version\n- `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` - Post-tick invariant checking\n- `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs` - Save/load roundtrip test\n- `crates/tank_core/tests/determinism.rs` - Basic determinism test\n- `crates/tank_core/tests/validation.rs` - Action validation tests\n- `crates/tank_data/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `serde`, `toml`, `thiserror`\n- `crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs` - Preset loading and validation scaffolding\n- `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` - Preset structs for source water, substrate, plants, shrimp, process params, scenarios\n- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/soft_acidic.toml` - Soft acidic water preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/moderate.toml` - Moderate water preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/hard_shrimp.toml` - Hard shrimp water preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/source_water/ro_like.toml` - RO-like water preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/inert_sand.toml` - Inert sand preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/inert_gravel.toml` - Inert gravel preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/active_planted.toml` - Active planted substrate preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/coarse_porous.toml` - Coarse porous media preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/plants/fast_stem.toml` - Fast stem plant guild preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/plants/root_rosette.toml` - Root feeding rosette preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml` - Neocaridina davidi preset\n- `crates/tank_data/data/process/default.toml` - Default process parameters pack\n- `crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/nano_cycle.toml` - Nano cycling scenario\n- `crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/medium_planted.toml` - Medium planted scenario\n- `crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/warm_room.toml` - Warm room scenario\n- `crates/tank_tui/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `ratatui`, `crossterm`, `tank_core`\n- `crates/tank_tui/src/lib.rs` - Placeholder module structure\n- `crates/tank_scenarios/Cargo.toml` - Dependencies: `tank_core`, `tank_data`\n- `crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` - Placeholder module structure\n\n## Dependencies\n- Requires: none (this is the foundation)\n- Blocks: all subsequent features (geometry/temperature, dissolved pools, nitrogen cycle, substrate/plants, shrimp, TUI)\n\n---"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5764,"cache_read_input_tokens":22066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5764},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aebe6b9c-6489-43f0-a717-82e4691947f3","uuid":"aca78783-b43c-43a5-9d48-66d0a2a719b6"}
